    {
      "id": "defeat.annolondon",
      "label": "Clara Has Fallen!",
      "startdescription": "“I know. I was merely making excuses for my own destruction. Perhaps my life was nothing but hypocritical chaos from beginning to end. Perhaps I was always a wolf forced to wear a mask. Perhaps... perhaps, like my sister, I was born at the start of the century and died never having existed.”",
