    {
      "id": "annolondon.fighting.attack.defense",
      "label": "Clara Attacks!",
      "startdescription": "@#needsedgeheart|Clara holds her ten fingers falsely before her and plays notes that can only reach perfection amid destruction. She revels in it, a half-smile of delight at the corner of her mouth, the lace at her cuffs leaving scratches in the air. The unpredictable music, accompanied by a fierce wind, tears me apart.#needsedgegrail|Translucent blood wells up from the gaps in the floor, climbs along the satin trim onto her skirt, and dots her whole body with crimson gems. She rises on tiptoe and spins halfway; the sound of shattered pearls suddenly rises, and blood stains crawl up my ankles...#needsedgelantern|Clara raises both arms, the knuckles exposed at the ends of her kid gloves pointing toward the skylight. The dust dancing in the light pauses, and suddenly transforms into countless spikes that surge toward me, each flickering with an eerie light—@",
